stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT: customer checks out
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> SEARCHING: mock payment approved (money HELD)
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED: customer / admin cancels
  SEARCHING --> ACCEPTED: approved helper of the right kind accepts (mechanic or driver, first one wins)
  SEARCHING --> CANCELLED: cancel (refund)
  ACCEPTED --> EN_ROUTE: helper on the way
  ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED: cancel (refund)
  EN_ROUTE --> IN_PROGRESS: mechanic arrives / driver picks up
  IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_CONFIRMATION: helper marks done
  AWAITING_CONFIRMATION --> COMPLETED: customer confirms (money RELEASED)
  AWAITING_CONFIRMATION --> DISPUTED: customer reports a problem
  DISPUTED --> COMPLETED: admin rejects dispute (pay helper)
  DISPUTED --> REFUNDED: admin refunds
  COMPLETED --> REFUNDED: warranty claim refunded
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  REFUNDED --> [*]
